        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Melville Shavelson, Armand Schaefer\n- Products: Houseboat, Sinister Hands, Yours, Mine and Ours\n- Roles: film director, producer, screenwriter, author\n\nFacts:\n- Armand Schaefer was a Canadian film producer and director who lived from August 5, 1898 to September 26, 1967.\n- Sinister Hands is a 1932 American film directed by Armand Schaefer.\n- Melville Shavelson was an American film director, producer, screenwriter, and author who lived from April 1, 1917 to August 8, 2007.\n- Melville Shavelson directed Houseboat.\n- Melville Shavelson also directed the original version of Yours, Mine and Ours in 1968.",
